{"ticker":"MCHP","updated":"2026-11-27T23:07:08Z","profile":{"longName":"Microchip Technology Incorporated","shortName":"Microchip Technology Incorporat","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","country":"United States","website":"https://www.microchip.com","fullTimeEmployees":17900,"marketCap":32854779904,"trailingPE":45.390976,"forwardPE":13.660225,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.8633647,"pegRatio":15.6,"targetMeanPrice":85.28,"targetHighPrice":120.0,"targetLowPrice":62.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":25,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.422,"earningsGrowth":25.418,"grossMargins":0.62701,"operatingMargins":0.21565,"profitMargins":0.14957,"totalRevenue":5603400192,"beta":1.852,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":105.91,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":52.37,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.16},"summary":"Microchip Technology Incorporated develops, manufactures, and sells smart, connected, and secure embedded control solutions in the Americas, Europe, and Asia. It operates in two segments, Semiconductor Products and Technology Licensing. The company offers general-purpose 8-bit, 16-bit, 32-bit, and 64-bit mixed-signal microcontrollers; 32-bit and 64-bit embedded mixed-signal microprocessors; and specialized mixed-signal microcontrollers for automotive, industrial, computing, communications, lighting, power supplies, motor control, human-machine interface, security, wired connectivity, and wireless connectivity applications. It also provides analog products, including power management, linear, mixed-signal, high voltage, thermal management, discrete diodes and MOSFETs, radio frequency (RF), gate drivers, safety, security, timing, application-specific standard products, USB, Ethernet, wireless, and other interface products; field-programmable gate array (FPGA) products; and application development tools that enable system designers to program mixed-signal microcontroller, FPGA, and microprocessor products. In addition, the company offers memory products consisting of serial electrically erasable programmable read-only memory, serial flash memories, parallel flash memories, serial static random-access memory, and electrically erasable random-access memory for footprint devices. Fur","summary_zh":"Microchip Technology Incorporated 在美洲、歐洲和亞洲開發、製造和銷售智慧、互聯和安全的嵌入式控制解決方案。它分為兩個部門：半導體產品部門和技術許可部門。該公司提供通用8位元、16位元、32位元和64位元混合訊號微控制器；32位元和64位元嵌入式混合訊號微處理器；以及用於汽車、工業、運算、通訊、照明、電源、馬達控制、人機介面、安全、有線連接和無線連接應用的專用混合訊號微控制器。它還提供類比產品，包括電源管理、線性、混合訊號、高壓、熱管理、分離式二極體和MOSFET、射頻(RF)、閘極驅動器、安全性、保全、定時、專用標準產品、USB、乙太網路、無線和其他介面產品；現場可程式閘陣列 (FPGA) 產品；以及微組件開發工具，使系統控制器此外，該公司還提供串行電可擦除可程式唯讀記憶體、串行快閃記憶體、並行快閃記憶體、串行靜態隨機存取記憶體和用於封裝裝置的電可擦除隨機存取記憶體等記憶體產品。皮草","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"半導體","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":64.88,"h":65.11,"l":64.01,"c":64.07,"v":6499700},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":64.27,"h":64.87,"l":63.03,"c":64.22,"v":7686700},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":63.98,"h":64.89,"l":63.33,"c":64.11,"v":8399400},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":64.78,"h":67.06,"l":64.42,"c":66.13,"v":6221000},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":66.39,"h":69.0,"l":66.35,"c":66.54,"v":6368300},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":67.23,"h":67.77,"l":64.35,"c":66.59,"v":6410200},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":67.03,"h":67.42,"l":64.74,"c":64.96,"v":6049300},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":65.32,"h":67.13,"l":64.68,"c":66.92,"v":6149900},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":66.7,"h":66.75,"l":65.08,"c":65.86,"v":3842600},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":65.98,"h":66.29,"l":60.2,"c":60.41,"v":12554600},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":62.8,"h":64.92,"l":62.18,"c":64.39,"v":8316300},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":62.22,"h":66.61,"l":62.22,"c":64.6,"v":9058400},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":65.5,"h":65.75,"l":63.66,"c":65.21,"v":10045600},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":65.97,"h":66.41,"l":64.39,"c":65.35,"v":5193200},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":64.81,"h":65.63,"l":64.26,"c":65.14,"v":4582800},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":66.07,"h":67.67,"l":65.65,"c":67.07,"v":5562100},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":66.96,"h":68.0,"l":66.31,"c":67.52,"v":5611900},{"t":"2025-10-22","o":65.21,"h":66.06,"l":63.3,"c":64.5,"v":9989800},